  "description": "A talented young chef is shocked that his once cheerful and chubby friend who loved his cooking now has anorexia. He is saddened that his friend is underweight and no longer wants to eat the food he makes, so he invites him home in hopes to improve his health with his cooking. However, what will happen when his friend suddenly realises that he can only eat food that is placed atop his sweetly scented skin? Will he offer his body to be feasted upon?\n\n(Source: Bookcube, translated)",
